                <pb facs="0630" n="550" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg550"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Raikes to Mr. Adee.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >British Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Bar Harbor,
                                Me.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1902-09-05"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 5,
                    1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Lord Lansdowne desires me to express on behalf of His Majesty’s Government their
                    heartfelt congratulations on the President’s merciful escape from serious
                    injury.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Raikes</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
